    "created_at": "2024-01-27T23:18:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-01-27T23:18:38Z",
    "body": "Seems Gecko chose custom code to avoid frame reconstruction when going fullscreen? In which case `overflow: clip` (which wasn't implemented at the time Gecko made the change) might be a better choice?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
